12), with the margin 'Hebrew reins' glossing this word (rule 38). No reordering; the earlier swap to mind was an error.", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.2.009"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.2.009", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t010"], "target_head": "t010"}, {"id": "PSA.26.2.a010", "note": "Possessive suffix on כִלְיוֹת → my (of heart), rule 18.", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.2.010"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.2.010", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t009"], "target_head": "t009"}, {"id": "PSA.26.2.a011", "note": "Waw → and.", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.2.011"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.2.011", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t011"], "target_head": "t011"}, {"id": "PSA.26.2.a012", "note": "לֵב → mind, the ASV's rendering of לֵב wherever it stands beside כליות rendered heart; source order preserved.", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.2.012"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.2.012", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t013"], "target_head": "t013"}, {"id": "PSA.26.2.a013", "note": "Possessive suffix on לֵב → my (of mind), rule 18.", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.2.013"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.2.013", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t012"], "target_head": "t012"}], "ref": "PSA.26.2", "review_notes": ["Reconciliation patch: heart ↔ כִלְיוֹתַי and mind ↔ לִבִּי in source order; the margin 'Hebrew reins' glosses heart and corroborates the mapping (rule 38).", "Variant v001 (covers s007–s008) underdetermined, base retained; nothing excluded (rule 53)."], "source_edition": "ASV-alignment Hebrew projection", "target_edition": "ASV", "variant_decisions": [{"base_source_ids": ["WLC.PSA.26.2.007", "WLC.PSA.26.2.008"], "compatible_readings": ["r00-base", "r01"], "evidence": "ASV 'Try my heart and my mind' renders an imperative of צרף; qere צָרְפָה and ketiv צרופה are orthographic variants of the same lengthened imperative and both yield 'try'. No italic supply, and the only note (hebrew_gloss on 'reins') concerns 'mind', not this verb. Retain the qere base fallback.", "fallback_used": true, "operational_reading": "r00-base", "projected_source_ids": ["WLC.PSA.26.2.007", "WLC.PSA.26.2.008"], "ref": "PSA.26.2", "selected_reading": null, "status": "underdetermined", "unit_id": "WLC.PSA.26.2.v001"}]}
