{"alignments": [{"id": "PSA.26.7.a001", "note": "Purpose לְ + infinitive recast as finite clause: the complementizer That is the preposition's (rule 52).", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.7.001"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.7.001", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t001"], "target_head": "t001"}, {"id": "PSA.26.7.a002", "note": "Hiphil infinitive takes supplied subject and modal (rule 52) and the light-verb rendering make ... to be heard, headed on heard (rule 44); discontinuous around the object.", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.7.002"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.7.002", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t002", "t003", "t004", "t009", "t010", "t011"], "target_head": "t011"}, {"id": "PSA.26.7.a003", "note": "בְּקוֹל is promoted to the direct object of make ... heard; the ASV spends no word on the preposition (rule 40). Margin 'publish with the voice' read and set aside (rule 38).", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.7.003"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.7.003", "status": "unrepresented", "target": [], "target_head": null}, {"id": "PSA.26.7.a004", "note": "Construct noun takes supplied the (rule 29).", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.7.004"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.7.004", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t005", "t006"], "target_head": "t006"}, {"id": "PSA.26.7.a005", "note": "Rectum takes of (rule 19).", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.7.005"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.7.005", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t007", "t008"], "target_head": "t008"}, {"id": "PSA.26.7.a006", "note": "", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.7.006"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.7.006", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t012"], "target_head": "t012"}, {"id": "PSA.26.7.a007", "note": "Second purpose לְ: the ASV writes no word for it, coordinating tell under the first clause's That (rule 52/40).", "source": ["WLC.PSA.26.7.007"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.26.7.007", "status": "unrepresented", "target": [], "target_head": null}, {"id": "PSA.26.7.a008", "note": "Infinitive → tell; the supplied of reaches the bare object כָּל־נִפְלְאוֹתֶיךָ and belongs to